Dependencies
------------

- github.com/cB-Sigma/iec62351 (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 Abhinav
  Gautam): the TLS profile.
- github.com/cB-Sigma/tlsx (BSD-3-Clause, a fork of Go's crypto/tls;
  Copyright The Go Authors, changes and additions Copyright 2026 Abhinav
  Gautam).
- Indirect: github.com/cB-Sigma/iotsec and github.com/cB-Sigma/iotcrypto
